From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:16:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): bring session label editing up to its PR

Send a removed project default as a null label instead of
apply_project_labels; keep the new session's label edits in the composer
draft; take an edit still in progress when a dialog saves or closes; keep
Save in view while the label dialogs scroll. Matches
https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent/pull/11399.

Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
